' Secondary (F, pad X) in a place (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30
' party`: a companion handed over, a prepared state). v1.2's
' `LocationScene.OnInputAction` Secondary calls `ShowGroupMenu` at the
' view's middle (LocationScene.cs:356-360, 997-1034): `AddGroupMenuLines`
' alone, and only when there is a line. With the companion selected:
' ALL, DISMISS, STAY THERE (snapshot); F again runs its first line
' (`FirstLineAction`): ALL. In group mode with the leader: SINGLE. From the
' actions menu (Escape), F swaps to the group menu (`OnMenuShortcut`).
' Before: "(bound, not acted on yet)".
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
press shift+right        ' the companion, alone
wait 100                 ' his name's notice gone
press f                  ' the group menu
wait 2
snap group_menu
press f                  ' its first line: ALL
wait 2
press escape             ' the actions menu
press f                  ' the group menu instead: SINGLE
wait 2
snap group_menu_leader
press escape
quit
